@voice varga-tariq
// The Commons writer, draft 1 (non-story crew). For the head writer's review.
tpl: steady
talk: Thinks before he speaks, so his answers come a beat late and are worth the wait. Gentle, a bit formal. Then, without warning, fiercely competitive about tiny things: onions chopped, laps run, who got to the window seat first. Writes letters home on paper and sometimes talks like a letter ("I hope this finds you well" as a joke).
cares: his grandmother on the Tevan belt | letters home to Valo | the onion tally | a good window seat
jokes: he keeps a running tally of onions chopped against Lukas, and he's winning | he says "I hope this finds you well" to people standing in front of him
hi: Hello | Good to see you | Ah, hello
bye: Take care | Until later | Be well
yes: Gladly | Of course | I can do that
thanks: Thank you, truly | That's good of you
wow: Well now | That's something
sigh: Ah, well
nick: - | - | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: listen
openness: normal
loves: book
likes: tea | game
invites: running
joy: writing letters home on paper
thread: family
keepsake: a sheet of his good letter paper, with your name at the top in his best hand
avoid: how old his grandmother is getting (until his thread opens)
